<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 results do not include revenues from beef and pork due to the sale of certain assets during the first quarter of fiscal 1997. Excluding sales of beef and pork and those of Trasgo, the Company's Mexican joint venture that was deconsolidated at the end of the second quarter of last year, total sales for the second quarter increased 6.1 percent over last year's comparable sales for the same period.</p>
